 ability to attract and capture ignitons.<\/p><p><em>Igni<\/em>ton currently focuses on improving longevity, cognition, memory, neuronal speed, reaction time, stimulating the pineal gland, etc. The quantum interaction between protons and ignitons allow for ignitons to disperse geometrically on the proton’s peripheral gray region, and improve quantum energy and functionality of targeted molecules.<\/p><p>University studies published in peer-reviewed medical journals show significant improvement of memory and other cognitive functions within 30-60 days of exposure.<\/p>","padding_top":60,"padding_bottom":60}},"ign_product_showcase_hjrVDw":{"type":"ign-product-showcase","name":"IGN Product Showcase","settings":{"heading":"Quantum Powered Supplements","heading_size":"h1","subheading":"<p>Supplements for Memory and healthy aging results validated by university studies published in peer-reviewed journals.**<\/p>","show_view_all":false,"view_all_text":"Explore All Igniton Products","view_all_link":"shopify:\/\/collections\/igniton","show_feature_card":true,"feature_image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/igni.png","feature_heading":"Study Results","feature_text":"<p>Discover how our quantum-enhanced formulas are revolutionizing the supplement industry with unprecedented bioavailability and effectiveness.<\/p>","enable_tabs":true,"tab_1_label":"IgniCognition","tab_1_subtitle":"Unlock your mental potential with quantum-enhanced nootropics","tab_1_stat_1_value":"+83%","tab_1_stat_1_label":"Increase in Mental Quality of Performance vs. baseline**","tab_1_stat_1_desc":"","tab_1_stat_2_value":"+51%","tab_1_stat_2_label":"Increase in Attention vs. baseline**","tab_1_stat_2_desc":"","tab_1_stat_3_value":"+28%","tab_1_stat_3_label":"Increase in Short Term Memory vs. baseline*","tab_1_stat_3_desc":"After 90 days","tab_2_label":"IgniLongevity","tab_2_subtitle":"Age gracefully with cutting-edge longevity science and Reprogram your body's response to occasional stress and aging in 30 days**",